the scoreboard.  For example:if "Yar, the Bug Slayer" has a score of 128003 on the scoreboard at diff 0,then his game at diff 1 and a score of 4112 would replace his previousentry on the scoreboard.  Note that when a player dies, his inventory isstored in the scoreboard so that everyone can see what items the player hadat the time of his death.